ement elementor-element-e246afa elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"e246afa\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2 class=\"elementor-heading-title elementor-size-default\">New Construction<\/h2>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-87d39ff elementor-section-height-min-height elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-items-middle\" data-id=\"87d39ff\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;,&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-44167c8\" data-id=\"44167c8\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-inner-section elementor-element elementor-element-af5a24d elementor-section-full_width elementor-reverse-mobile elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"af5a24d\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;jet_parallax_layout_list&quot;:[]}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-005fc1d\" data-id=\"005fc1d\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-615a239 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"615a239\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"263\"><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Custom Homes Built to Fit<\/span><strong data-start=\"199\" data-end=\"263\"> Your Vision, Lifestyle &amp; Future<\/strong><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bc815fb elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"bc815fb\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p data-start=\"265\" data-end=\"513\">Building a new home is one of the most exciting\u2014and important\u2014investments you\u2019ll ever make. At <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us\/\"style=\"color:#000000; text-decoration:underline;\"><strong data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"377\">Harris &amp; Sons<\/strong><\/a>, we believe your new construction project should reflect your style, serve your family\u2019s needs, and be built to stand the test of time.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"515\" data-end=\"858\">From the ground up, we manage the entire custom home-building process with a focus on quality craftsmanship, transparent communication, and attention to detail. Whether you&#8217;re starting with a raw plot of land or need help refining your floor plan, we bring your dream home to life with precision and care\u2014just like we would for our own family.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-inner-column elementor-element elementor-element-a92dace\" data-id=\"a92dace\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div